# issue-read: gone unavailable
# request: start activate stop clear-error recover
# actor: none template policy-only partial partial-running partial-crashed suspended running crashed resuming suspending reverting deleting unspecified unknown
# rule issue-gone: 75 cases
# rule issue-unavailable: 75 cases
# issue-read  request  actor                                                                                                                   outcome
gone          *        *                                                                                                                       issue-gone delete!abort
unavailable   *        none|template|policy-only|partial|partial-crashed|suspended|crashed|resuming|suspending|reverting|deleting|unspecified  issue-unavailable -
unavailable   *        partial-running|running|unknown                                                                                         issue-unavailable suspend!log
